82F6, secondary #050505, accent #1D4ED8, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aura - Sign In</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-gray-200 antialiased opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 ease-out selection:bg-blue-500/30 selection:text-blue-100\"\n      style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #050505; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 4px 4px;\"\n      onload=\"document.body.classList.remove('opacity-0')\">\n\n    <!-- Tiny Noise Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-[9999] mix-blend-overlay\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noise%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.8%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noise)%22 opacity=%220.08%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Skill: Container Lines (Vertical guides with mini squares) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center z-0\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl h-full border-l border-r border-white/[0.04] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[3px] top-40 w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -right-[3px] top-40 w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[3px] bottom-40 w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -right-[3px] bottom-40 w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen px-4 pt-12 pb-12 overflow-hidden\">\n\n        <!-- Header Branding -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-normal tracking-wide text-gray-400 mb-8 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-4 duration-700\">\n            <span class=\"tracking-widest uppercase\">Aura</span>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-blue-500 text-base\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-md\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight font-normal text-center leading-tight mb-8 text-white\">\n                Back to the Engine\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Login Card with Border Gradient -->\n            <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-blue-500/5 group\"\n                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n\n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#0a0a0a]/90 backdrop-blur-3xl rounded-[calc(1.5rem-1px)] p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col\">\n\n                    <!-- Google Auth Button -->\n                    <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3 w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] hover:bg-white/[0.08] transition-colors duration-200 text-sm font-normal text-gray-200 mb-6\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-blue-400\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Continue with Google\n                    </button>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\">\n                        <div class=\"h-[1px] flex-1 bg-white/5\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">or email</span>\n                        <div class=\"h-[1px] flex-1 bg-white/5\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Form Inputs -->\n                    <form class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"space-y-1.5\">\n                            <label class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 ml-1 font-normal\">Email address</label>\n                            <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\"\n                                   class=\"w-full bg-[#050505] border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500/50 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500/20 transition-all placeholder:text-gray-700 text-gray-200\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"space-y-1.5\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center ml-1\">\n                                <label class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-normal\">Password</label>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-blue-400/80 hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors\">Forgot?</a>\n                            </div>\n                            <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\"\n                                   class=\"w-full bg-[#050505] border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500/50 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500/20 transition-all placeholder:text-gray-700 text-gray-200\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Main Submit Button with Ripple Effect -->\n                        <div class=\"relative group mt-8\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-blue-500 blur-[20px] opacity-20 rounded-xl scale-95 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                            <button type=\"button\" id=\"main-btn\" class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center w-full h-12 rounded-xl outline-none transition-transform duration-300 active:scale-[0.98] overflow-hidden\"\n                                    style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3B82F6 0%, #1D4ED8 100%);\n                                           box-shadow: inset 0px 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3),\n                                                       0px 8px 16px -4px rgba(29, 78, 216, 0.5);\">\n\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-xl p-[1px] pointer-events-none\"\n                                     style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), rgba(255,255,255,0)); -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0); -webkit-mask-composite: xor; mask-composite: exclude;\"></div>\n\n                                <canvas id=\"webgl-ripple\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full rounded-xl pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen opacity-50\"></canvas>\n\n                                <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 pointer-events-none\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-white text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide\" style=\"text-shadow: 0px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                                        Sign In\n                                    </span>\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-white text-base\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"mt-8 text-center text-xs text-gray-500\">\n                New to the platform? <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-700\">Create an account</a>\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Hero Canvas Background (Dithered dots) -->\n        <canvas id=\"hero-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full -z-10 opacity-40\"></canvas>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Hero Background Simulation\n        const heroCanvas = document.getElementById('hero-canvas');\n        const ctx = heroCanvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height, time = 0;\n\n        function resizeHero() {\n            width = heroCanvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = heroCanvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        }\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resizeHero);\n        resizeHero();\n\n        function drawHero() {\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#050505';\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n            const spacing = 32;\n            for(let i = 0; i <= width / spacing; i++) {\n                for(let j = 0; j <= height / spacing; j++) {\n                    const x = i * spacing;\n                    const y = j * spacing;\n                    const wave = Math.sin(x * 0.002 + y * 0.002 + time) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(59, 130, 246, ${wave * 0.15})`;\n                    ctx.fillRect(x, y, 1, 1);\n                }\n            }\n            time += 0.01;\n            requestAnimationFrame(drawHero);\n        }\n        drawHero();\n\n        // Ripple Effect\n        const rippleCanvas = document.getElementById('webgl-ripple');\n        const gl = rippleCanvas.getContext('webgl', { alpha: true });\n        if (gl) {\n            const vsSource = `attribute vec4 p; void main() { gl_Position = p; }`;\n            const fsSource = `precision mediump float; uniform vec2 r; uniform vec2 c; uniform float t;\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / r;\n                    vec2 cp = c / r; cp.y = 1.0 - cp.y;\n                    float d = length(uv - cp) * (r.x/r.y);\n                    float w = sin(d * 30.0 - t * 20.0);\n                    float env = smoothstep(t * 1.5 + 0.1, t * 1.5, d) * smoothstep(t * 1.5 - 0.3, t * 1.5, d);\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(1.0, 1.0, 1.0, w * env * (1.0 - t) * 0.4);\n                }`;\n            const program = gl.createProgram();\n            const createSh = (s, ty) => { const sh = gl.createShader(ty); gl.shaderSource(sh, s); gl.compileShader(sh); return sh; };\n            gl.attachShader(program, createSh(vsSource, gl.VERTEX_SHADER));\n            gl.attachShader(program, createSh(fsSource, gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER));\n            gl.linkProgram(program);\n            gl.useProgram(program);\n            const buf = gl.createBuffer();\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf);\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1,-1, 1,-1, -1,1, 1,1]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n            const pos = gl.getAttribLocation(program, \"p\");\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(pos);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(pos, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n            const rL = gl.getUniformLocation(program, \"r\"), cL = gl.getUniformLocation(program, \"c\"), tL = gl.getUniformLocation(program, \"t\");\n            let st = 0, ani = false;\n            const resz = () => { rippleCanvas.width = rippleCanvas.clientWidth; rippleCanvas.height = rippleCanvas.clientHeight; gl.viewport(0,0,rippleCanvas.width,rippleCanvas.height); gl.uniform2f(rL, rippleCanvas.width, rippleCanvas.height); };\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resz); resz();\n            const render = (now) => {\n                if (!ani) return; const el = (now - st) / 1000.0;\n                gl.uniform1f(tL, el); gl.clear(gl.COLOR_BUFFER_BIT); gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n                if (el < 1.0) requestAnimationFrame(render); else { ani = false; gl.clear(gl.COLOR_BUFFER_BIT); }\n            };\n            document.getElementById('main-btn').addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => {\n                const rect = rippleCanvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n                gl.uniform2f(cL, e.clientX - rect.left, e.clientY - rect.top);\n                st = performance.now(); if (!ani) { ani = true; requestAnimationFrame(render); }\n            });\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aura-sign-in.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aura-sign-in.jpg", "source_name": "aura-sign-in-DESIGN.md", "views": 74, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:55:28.328579+00:00"}